OL,3,GNEWSA'Emo might have been a phase to
OL,4,Asome, but not for us'
OL,5,
OL,6,FWhen My Chemical Romance headlined
OL,7,FWembley for three sold-out shows in
OL,8,FJuly, for many it was a trip down
OL,9,Fmemory lane to a time when they classed
OL,10,Fthemselves as "emo" - wearing black,
OL,11,Fhaving piercings and listening to
OL,12,Falternative music.
OL,14,FBut for others, this was never just a
OL,15,Fphase of their youth. This was a way of
OL,16,Flife.
OL,18,FSophie Baxter, 31, from Hull, describes
OL,19,Fherself as alternative and runs a
OL,20,Fsocial group for "emos, goths and
OL,21,Fmoshers" to meet like-minded people who
OL,22,F"understand where you're coming from".
OL,23,APub: 30-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
