OL,3,GNEWSA'Emo might have been a phase to
OL,4,Asome, but not for us'
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I think people who are not alternative
OL,7,Foften see it as a form of rebellion or
OL,8,Fa movement but it isn't, in my opinion
OL,9,Fanyway, it's just a lifestyle and a way
OL,10,Fof expressing who you are," she says.
